<p>\(\sum f_i={@total_frequencies@}\, \,\sum \bar{x}={@mean@}\,\,\sum f_ix_i={@sum_fi_xi@}\,,\sum f(x-\bar{x})^2={@sum_f_square_mean_m@}\)</p></p>

<hr>
<p>Mean of the grouped data \(=\displaystyle\frac{\sum f_ix_i}{\sum f_i}=\frac{{@sum_f_midpoints@}}{{@total_frequencies@}}={@ta1@}\)</p>
<p>Variance \(=\displaystyle\frac{\sum f_i(x_i-\bar{x})^2}{\sum f_i}=\frac{{@sum_f_square_mean_m@}}{{@total_frequencies@}}={@ta2@}\)</p>
<p>Standard deviation \(=\displaystyle\sqrt{\sigma^2}=\sqrt{@ta2@}={@ta3@}\)</p>
<p></p>
